{
 "encounter_id": "00921",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR",
  "person_3": "NURSE"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Dr Rao, this is Ms Kapoor, she's here about her periods. I've done her obs: blood pressure 110 over 70, pulse 72, weight 72 kilos. She's a bit nervous."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you, nurse. Come in, Ms Kapoor, sit down. You said your periods have gone strange? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, doctor, I'm so worried. Ever since I stopped the pill six months ago, my periods are irregular, sometimes forty days, sometimes sixty, and I think something is wrong."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "So irregular cycles since stopping the pill. What's the bleeding like when it does come?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Heavy. Very heavy the first two days, I'm soaking through pads."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And your skin?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Acne, along the jaw. It was never this bad before. Is it hormones?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Anything else you've noticed?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Some coarse hair on my chin, and I've started shaving it. And I'm moody, I snap at my mother."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Have you noticed any milky discharge from the breasts?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any headaches or changes in your vision?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No headaches, no vision changes."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Weight loss?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, I've put on a little."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Are you taking anything at the moment?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Just a folic acid, maybe 400 micrograms? I got it from the chemist when we were thinking of trying."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Okay. Any allergies?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Aspirin. I react to it, but I don't remember what happens, I only know it's on my record."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Fine. Medical history?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Anaemia a few years ago, and asthma as a child."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Surgery?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Tonsils, when I was seven. And my wisdom teeth, in 2019."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Anyone in the family with similar problems?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My mother has diabetes."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What do you do for work?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'm a software tester. Long hours, lots of sitting."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you drink?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No alcohol at all."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Exercise?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yoga, twice a week."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me examine you. Is that all right? Lie back and I'll feel your tummy.",
   "pause": 12.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Your abdomen is soft and not tender."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Good. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I can see acne along the jaw, and coarser hair on the chin."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is it serious? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any trouble passing urine?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing, it's normal."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What I'm seeing, with the long cycles, the acne and the chin hair, is probably polycystic ovary syndrome."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "PCOS? Will I be able to have children? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Very likely yes. Let me confirm first. I'd like to arrange a pelvic ultrasound, hormone blood tests, and a pregnancy test today."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I can do the pregnancy test now, doctor. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you. And I'd like to start norethisterone, 5 mg, twice a day for ten days, to bring on a proper period."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is it safe? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Yes. Expect a bleed a few days after you finish. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you again in four weeks."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Four weeks. Thank you, doctor. ~"
  }
